OL,3,GNEWSABelfast Met to cut thousands of
OL,4,Astudent places amid budget absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast Metropolitan College (BMC) has
OL,7,Fmade "unprecedented" cuts of 2,500
OL,8,Fstudent places and cancelled a range of
OL,9,Fcourses.
OL,11,FIn a statement, a college spokesperson
OL,12,Fsaid that the deadlock over a Stormont
OL,13,Fbudget was partially responsible.
OL,15,FThe executive has been unable to agree
OL,16,Fa budget and has appealed to the
OL,17,Fgovernment for more money.
OL,19,FBut, according to Belfast Met, that has
OL,20,Fmeant that Further Education (FE)
OL,21,FColleges have had a #33m cut in
OL,22,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
